## Predictions (written before the run)
- the ceiling works on frequency: the ceiling arm oscillates around twenty-five with at least one held->open transition followed by fresh cavern arrivals; the control runs measurably higher
- a one-way door: species are held once and never released even as the layer decays well below the ceiling
- frequency 1 is too weak a brake: the ceiling arm tracks the control — a 1-in-100 weight does not slow arrivals enough to hold a ceiling

